  SYNTHETIC SAMPLE — NO REAL TAXPAYER DATA. Written from scratch; all
  identities are deliberately fake.

  BRANCH PROVED: INVESTMENT INCENTIVE + RETURN (EARSIVFATURA / YTBIADE).

    · investmentIncentive — the model switches this block on for any invoice
      type starting with 'YTB' and looks for the certificate in an
      AdditionalDocumentReference whose type mentions YTB / TEŞVİK. Every other
      sample in the library has a non-YTB type, so without this one the whole
      block is dead code as far as the gate is concerned.
    · refundInvoiceReference — cac:BillingReference names the invoice being
      reversed.

  The two are combined deliberately: YTBIADE is exactly the real-world type where
  both conditions hold, so one document proves two branches without inventing an
  impossible combination.
-->
